PREDECESSOR BUILD-RESCUE — DECLARED (Honesty Covenant rules 7 & 9)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The inherited tree had NEVER been compiled. HEAD ("dedupe 11 type collisions",
a52455f9e) verified ONLY swiftlint + a duplicate-type text scan — never xcodebuild.
A first `xcodebuild` failed on a duplicate FILENAME, then duplicate TYPES, then a
pervasive cascade of "ambiguous #Preview / accessibilityAddTraits" errors.
Covenant rule 7 ("no predecessor bypass") required FIXING the tree, not skipping it.
These fixes are disclosed here (no silent drift, rule 9). All are within the
prompt's allowed scope (apps/apple/**). Every change is validated by 25778 unit +
34 UI tests passing on iOS and 25778 unit tests passing on macOS.

Keystone bug: a duplicate `extension TSSpacing { static let x2xl }` made
`TSSpacing.x2xl` ambiguous; every SwiftUI body using it failed to type-check and
the compiler emitted MISLEADING downstream "ambiguous #Preview" /
"ambiguous accessibilityAddTraits" errors. Removing the one duplicate cleared the
entire cascade (minimal standalone reproducers of those patterns compiled clean,
proving they were cascade, not real). A type-name dup scan missed it because it is
an extension MEMBER, not a type.

~30 classes of fixes across ~17 build rounds:
  * duplicate filename: git mv ScheduledExportsPanel.swift -> ...PanelView.swift
  * 8 duplicate type/extension collisions: TSSpacing/TSRadius dup removed from
    StatusApiDocsPage; HeroStatus->StatusHeroStatus; TirePressure{Unit,Convert,
    Status,Thresholds}->TirePressureWidget*; the x2xl extension-member dup.
  * 10 @MainActor added to @Observable page models.
  * 757 `@State private var model/viewModel` -> `@State var` (cross-file section
    access required internal, not file-private).
  * Swift.Error vs Shared.Error disambiguation (MyActivityPage).
  * Sendable conformances (RoadmapEntry/RoadmapPhase, MyActivityDataSource).
  * Localization API misuse fixes (Bundle.main.localizedString in NotFound /
    StatusApiDocs / Help / Diagnostic pages).
  * dedupe-rename-missed references (ScheduledExportsPanelView, DataRepair types,
    DBHealthPage title/border/formatTimestamp, SystemStatusPage model/auth/MainActor,
    SearchPageModel @MainActor, BatteryRadialGaugeModel Int64, DiagnosticPage
    fileprivate->internal + brace fix), TSEmptyState missing title, concurrency
    parameter/dataSource threading.
  * Toast.Tests.swift: testMutationFailedUsesLocalizedErrorDetail fixed to use a
    mapped key (was asserting on an unmapped "toast.mutation.unmapped" key).

Test-infra / gate hygiene (this artifact's own files):
  * Removed container-level accessibilityIdentifiers that promoted containers to
    accessibility elements and HID their identified children from XCUITest;
    identifiers kept on leaf elements only.
  * .swiftformat: `--disable wrapSingleLineComments` (it was wrapping long
    parity:allow marker comments); 7 long code lines wrapped; swiftlint length
    disable/enable regions where needed.
  * 80 placeholder false positives annotated `// parity:allow <reason>`
    ("TODO" matched substrings like statOdometer/testOdometer; "Placeholder"
    matched the legitimate text-field `placeholder` attribute).

Build-artifact hygiene: apps/apple/.gitignore added (DerivedData/, DerivedDataMac/);
note the repo root .gitignore ignores all nested .gitignore files, so this file is
not itself committed but its rules apply locally — DerivedData* are excluded from
the commit. (.xcodeproj, Frameworks/*.xcframework are already ignored.)

